From: Deividas Nastajus <16858119+dns54@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 22:43:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 16/25] UefiPayloadPkg/CfrSetupMenuDxe: Split the forms into
 two menus

All CFR forms share one page, the Platform Setup Menu, so the options
for this machine's hardware sit next to the firmware's own features.

Put forms flagged CFR_OPTFLAG_PLATFORM in the Platform Setup Menu and
the others in a new System Features menu, both in Device Manager. Each
menu is its own package list, as Device Manager only looks at the first
formset of one, and is published only when it gets forms. A form stays
a section of its menu, as before.

Option variables don't change, only where the options show up.

Signed-off-by: Deividas Nastajus <16858119+dns54@users.noreply.github.com>
